{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43497","headline":"玉巵无当 · 无名氏","name":"玉巵无当","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共惜连城宝，翻爲无当巵。\n讵慙君子贵，深讶拙工隳。\n泛蚁功全少，如虹色不移。\n可怜珍砾石，何计辨糟醨。\n江海诚难满，盘筵莫妄施。\n纵乖斟酌意，犹得奉光仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}